# Workflow Rules

- Plan before implementation for medium/large work.
- `plan-verify` is mandatory before execution workflows.
- Use numbered issues and lettered options during critical review.
- Ask for explicit approval before writing files for risky changes.
- Support these workflows with capability-gated behavior:
  - `/plan-ceo-review`, `/plan-eng-review`, `/plan-design-review`
  - `/review`, `/ship`, `/browse`, `/qa`, `/qa-only`, `/qa-design-review`
  - `/setup-browser-cookies`, `/retro`, `/document-release`
- Use Cursor browser tooling for browser-backed checks.
- If runtime capabilities are missing, switch to report-only mode and list prerequisites.

{{WORKFLOW_RULES}}
